{"availability":"available","full":"griffainai/studio-pipeline-operator","name":"studio-pipeline-operator","description":"A folder-based AI operator that runs a digital studio's whole sales pipeline — it decides each lead's disposition, drafts the next action, and routes the card to the right stage. ICM: the folder is the agent. Live interactive demo.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":4,"created":"2026-06-13T06:52:41Z","updated":"2026-06-13T19:31:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://pipeline-operator.vercel.app/board","topics":["ai-agent","claude","crm","icm","interpretable-context","kanban","nextjs","sales-pipeline"],"demo":"https://pipeline-operator.vercel.app/board","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:41.969Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:41.969Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:41.969Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:41.969Z","stars":8,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A folder-based AI operator that runs a diagnostic-first digital studio's entire sales pipeline — inbound or outbound lead, all the way to a closed deal. You paste in a lead at any stage; it decides the disposition, drafts the next action, and tells you exactly what to write to the CRM. You just send or call.","Built for: a solo studio founder selling $750–$12,500 engagements who sources 40–60 leads a week and loses half their day to triage and follow-through instead of selling.","▶ Live demo — a working pipeline, not a slide: — an interactive Kanban seeded with real leads. Paste a lead into the Run panel and watch the operator decide live (on the real API, loading this exact folder as its system prompt) and move the card into the right stage bucket. Click any card for the full lead detail — score breakdown, activity timeline, and a working dialer, email composer, and scheduler. Or run the side-by-side duel against a generic assistant."],"feat